{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00414",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.84,
      "end_seconds": 7.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "Hi there, um, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.26,
      "end_seconds": 13.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.76,
      "end_seconds": 19.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Well, I've been dealing with a dry cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.81,
      "end_seconds": 25.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "When did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.27,
      "end_seconds": 37.51,
      "duration_seconds": 11.24,
      "text": "Probably three weeks. Yeah. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.74,
      "end_seconds": 43.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "I follow. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.08,
      "end_seconds": 55.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "Hmm, I'd call it severe. It's once or twice a day. I had occasional wheeze before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.08,
      "end_seconds": 74.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.11,
      "text": "Have you noticed coughing up blood, leg swelling, chest pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.16,
      "end_seconds": 86.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "No, uh, no coughing up blood, leg swelling, chest pain or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.88,
      "end_seconds": 91.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Did you notice any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.1,
      "end_seconds": 95.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "No, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.87,
      "end_seconds": 99.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.14,
      "end_seconds": 104.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.87,
      "end_seconds": 121.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.39,
      "end_seconds": 126.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Pollen. I come out in... well, a runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.32,
      "end_seconds": 140.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Do you exercise at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.39,
      "end_seconds": 149.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "I go to the gym a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.73,
      "end_seconds": 152.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "And your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.95,
      "end_seconds": 157.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "I drive a delivery van all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.89,
      "end_seconds": 161.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Right, is anyone at home with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.03,
      "end_seconds": 167.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I share a flat with two friends."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.33,
      "end_seconds": 169.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.1,
      "end_seconds": 173.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.78,
      "end_seconds": 177.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.72,
      "end_seconds": 182.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.72,
      "end_seconds": 188.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Before we go on, a few quick readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.86,
      "end_seconds": 199.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.64,
      "end_seconds": 226.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 94 percent on room air, pressure 123 over 88, temperature 37.0. And respiratory rate 23, heart rate 94."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.97,
      "end_seconds": 228.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.33,
      "end_seconds": 232.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "That's fine, we'll come to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.44,
      "end_seconds": 237.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Right, let me check a few things physically."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.19,
      "end_seconds": 241.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Hold that position for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.99,
      "end_seconds": 261.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "There are fine crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.94,
      "end_seconds": 265.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Let me just check something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.57,
      "end_seconds": 284.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.89,
      "end_seconds": 297.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "That's fine, sit up. Okay, thinking it through, it points towards chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.63,
      "end_seconds": 302.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Um, is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.87,
      "end_seconds": 332.62,
      "duration_seconds": 28.75,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up, and we'll know more once the a chest X-ray is back. Let's book a chest X-ray to look into chronic breathlessness. I'm sending you for an echocardiogram because of breathlessness. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.94,
      "end_seconds": 336.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Alright, when would that be?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.56,
      "end_seconds": 359.69,
      "duration_seconds": 21.13,
      "text": "Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop. I'd like you to see a chest physician as well, and I'll write the referral. Please don't wait if the symptoms get worse. That's when to be seen urgently. I'll want another look in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.44,
      "end_seconds": 364.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Sure, uh, that's doable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.33,
      "end_seconds": 368.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "That's it on my side. Anything unclear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.28,
      "end_seconds": 375.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Thanks, that was helpful."
    }
  ]
}